  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="34">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 34</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And bete man ægðer ge him ge þam cynge, swa swa hit gebirige, be þam þe séo dæd sy, oððe he ða dæde wrece swiðe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And compensation according to the nature of the deed shall be paid both to him and to the king, as is fitting, or he (the king) shall avenge the deed to the uttermost.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
